1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,816
Every integrity function your operators need, on one tablet, with no server and no connection.

2
00:00:08,216 --> 00:00:17,696
Start on the dashboard. Key indicators, a heatmap of every monitoring point, and symbols that tell you what the equipment is at a glance.

3
00:00:19,096 --> 00:00:27,664
Open a point. The pictogram says what it is, the state says how bad it is, and the trend shows where it is going.

4
00:00:29,064 --> 00:00:39,168
Register assets against ISO 14224. The category carries its symbol, and the risk band drives the inspection interval.

5
00:00:40,568 --> 00:00:48,176
Relief valves keep their own registry, with sizing and overdue tests flagged in red before anyone has to ask.

6
00:00:49,576 --> 00:01:00,016
A pipeline is not an icon. It is a kilometres bar: severity per segment, every asset placed by station, findings where they happened.

7
00:01:01,516 --> 00:01:11,644
Inject the field round as a CSV. Columns are mapped automatically, every row is validated, and the bad one is rejected with a reason.

8
00:01:13,144 --> 00:01:17,944
Run the rules and the app turns readings into ranked recommendations.

9
00:01:19,244 --> 00:01:25,076
Then generate the dossier on the device, ready to print, sign and hand over.

10
00:01:26,476 --> 00:01:32,788
Field data. Field decisions. No signal required.

